{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to [Wuli Sandbox], a physics-driven sandbox world. Here, you can freely observe, create, and experiment. We provide a set of engaging simulation systems, not a </strong><i>lavish narrative</i><strong>. Every change in this world stems from your creativity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843960/extras/e47dd3158e6143ca074348c289677919.poster.avif?t=1755966413\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843960/extras/e47dd3158e6143ca074348c289677919.webm?t=1755966413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843960/extras/e47dd3158e6143ca074348c289677919.mp4?t=1755966413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open experimentation platform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State of matter changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chemical reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat conduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cellular automata (The Game of Life)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions and combustion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rigid and soft bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843960/extras/baa41b5b7b535b048259ff269ef78bd4.poster.avif?t=1755966413\" width=780 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843960/extras/baa41b5b7b535b048259ff269ef78bd4.webm?t=1755966413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s